# version. Three words, in order, each idempotent (deed 1622 spelled the
# long forms and the operator asked for short ones the same afternoon):
#   botify --sw               (the SpeedWorkers census: has_sw=True, category__exact=1, id and project_links baked in)
#   botify --pull-configs     (SiteCrawler + SpeedWorkers per project off the newest queue, resumable, --limit 1000 by default)
